      "message": "Previously, \"sdk\" variants are emitted\n- without \".sdk\" suffix for unbundled build\n- with \".sdk\" suffix for platform build\n\nNow, \"sdk\" variants are emitted with \".sdk\" suffix for both builds (unbundled or platform)  since SDK variants are always marked as `SdkAndPlatformVariantVisibleToMake`.\n\nIIUC, with the current change, I guess rewriting deps to \".sdk\" for modules using SDK variants should work for both builds.",
